msgstr "一个冗余 5.3V 舵机连接器，通过标准舵机线缆连接飞控舵机轨道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:49
#: 02c1cb48a4af436d9317fa7520a03624 0a4ade2d5df441d9972a101e04565264
#: 2687b1c22f6541839ff579a24201ed3c 5b1ea61baa3646349b199d3e793847c9
